{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>למאחרים</b> — deficient [in spelling]. And so it is למאחרים [for those who tarry] over wine." "<b>ממסך</b> — an adjective on the pattern of ממשח, and its meaning is mixed wine, from מסכה יינה [her wine is mixed]."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:23.475975127Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}